# Kang the Conqueror: "During that turn, power-up abilities can't be activated" is the extra turn his ability made and no
# other. Kang powers up on turn 1 (the turn he enters, {3}{U}), and turn 2 is his extra turn. Bot1 casts Time Walk in it:
# turn 3 is Time Walk's extra turn, not Kang's, so Ultron Drone, cast in it, has its power-up activated for the {3} it
# costs the turn it enters (CR 702.193b).

